e":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ZDV6ocQSe6dkMt-u011xcQ","review_id":"_d29Bf9h6BtMibfWYuKvGg","date":"2009-08-06T20:09:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.955390989780426,"text_excerpt":"After much deliberating and researching on Yelp and Trip Advisor, I finally decided EAT would be the perfect Saturday dinner spot for my two gal pals and myself. DAMN I love being right! This adorable little spot is an HGTV dream come true. The walls are painted pale blue and white curtains and linens soften the space. Décor is sparse, but dripping with charm. Loved it! It's so nice to get away from all the kitsch you find in most of the Quarter. EAT is also in a great location. Just one block off Bourbon - but it seems a world away because it's so relaxed and quiet. Our waiter was PRECIOUS! I honestly wanted to put him in my pocket and take him with me. Service was great, and it really d..."},{"business_id":"ZDV6ocQSe6dkMt-u011xcQ","review_id":"7CO0hDQ4vycxMKVg90YJzA","date":"2012-03-28T20:40:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9460742473602295,"text_excerpt":"Oh man. I came here for brunch with the ladies since it was right down the street from our hotel (The Best Western on Rampart) and it did not disappoint. (I don't brunch but I was forced to, so if brunch = alcoholic breakfast, make sure you walk down to \"Good Friends\" or another local bar to grab a Bloody Mary or something while you wait. There is no alcohol on the menu). First of all, the place is small but it has such great ambiance. There are gorgeous canvas portraits on the walls and it just has an overall cozy look inside. There are also local goods for sale here which I think is sweet. The menu is small but has such quality food. I had a local specialty, the boudin, which was FANFRE..."},{"business_id":"ZDV6ocQSe6dkMt-u011xcQ","review_id":"sHJZ6SpPtAHtbDeS0WdIZw","date":"2010-11-24T02:00:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9415585994720459,"text_excerpt":"Yum, this place is really awesome. We ate here twice during our trip and both times were excellent. Our servers were super nice and we never had to wait for a table. Service was a little bit slow but the place was pretty crowded! The first time we came here we weren't super hungry so we decided to split an appetizer and a main course. Fried green tomatoes remoulade are something to be tried. They're delicious and something I've always heard about but never have had the chance to eat. We also shared \"The Trio\", which had gumbo, red beans, and a stuffed pepper. Mmm. All 3 were drool worthy. Second night we came here we were really hungry and each got a main course. My boyfriend tried the po..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZDV6ocQSe6dkMt-u011xcQ","photo_id":"_4oUw-gB_ysa39a2ePDIXQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_4oUw-gB_ysa39a2ePDIXQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8729537725448608},{"business_id":"ZDV6ocQSe6dkMt-u011xcQ","photo_id":"ifksaJQFk13Lc92x_XRAfw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ifksaJQFk13Lc92x_XRAfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8665254712104797},{"business_id":"ZDV6ocQSe6dkMt-u011xcQ","photo_id":"YyJXRNHVvRVqY3ndbhPzwQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YyJXRNHVvRVqY3ndbhPzwQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8487563133239746},{"business_id":"ZDV6ocQSe6dkMt-u011xcQ","photo_id":"8mPziSYvuO4oiHg32Q-j_A","label":"insid